---
/* The loader is chapter 08's wall, pinned up around one drawing: one of Belgium's goals of 2018, a different one at random
   on each visit (scripts/objects/board94.js, GOALS — the words below are those of the 94th minute in Rostov and are replaced).
   The pitch draws itself on a yellow sheet, the players are stamped on, and then the page's loading plays the move.
   Every touch of the ball throws more
   of the story onto the wall around the sheet: prints, album stickers, tickets, scores, badges, drawings
   (scripts/objects/wall.js). When the ball is in the net a red slab slams across with the score. The slab then
   takes the whole screen — a red sheet grows out of it, a yellow one under it — and both are lifted off in one move;
   the first screen comes in under them (scripts/loader.js). No big percentage: the count is on the label. */
---
<div class="ld ld5" id="ld" aria-hidden="true">
  <i class="ld-gr"></i>
  <div class="tb94-sheet" id="lbSheet">
    <svg class="tb94" id="lbSvg"></svg>
    <span class="mono tb94-cap">Rostov Arena · 02.07.2018 · BEL attacking →</span>
    <i class="tape t"></i><i class="tape tr"></i>
  </div>
  <div class="wall ld-wall" id="ldWall"></div>
  <span class="d ld-sl ld-sl1" id="ldS1" data-torn="tb" data-torn-d="8">90+4′</span>
  <i class="ld-fl ld-fl2"></i><i class="ld-fl ld-fl1"></i>
  <span class="d ld-sl ld-ko" id="ldKo">3—2.</span>
  <p class="mono ld-lab">00 — <span id="ldWhere">Rostov, 2 July 2018</span> · <b id="ldN">0</b>%</p>
  <span class="hand c-r ld-note" id="ldNote">ten seconds, box to box</span>
</div>
